5ecd05d" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425479 1074 "We have $\\frac{4}{15}$ on the left and $\\frac{12}{15}$ on the right.\n\n![](images/b8/b825a5a1e63a0ac768bb89ca90f7a99c943cda074c336594f48b55cdc2750684.png)\n\nThe shape on the left has $4$ shaded pieces, and the shape on the right has $12$ shaded pieces. So the number of shaded pieces has increased by a factor of $3.$\n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{15}\\times 3=\\frac{12}{15}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $3.$" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425480 1068 #edb/ref 17592186425466 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425480 1069 "q-136830" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425480 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425480 1071 "![](images/90/909b748b912bc0cae486950cb732d267f6ce22c0267930e8e8677d87bd6b68db.png)\n\nWhat picture is missing from the multiplication model above?" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425480 1072 #uuid "0e2aa59e-6c33-5338-b457-37a2f36f9432" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425480 1074 "In the model, we have $\\frac{3}{4}$ multiplied by $3.$ This means that we need to make $3$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](images/2f/2f08da3896c1162fb008db78bc9e86bc966b1d6431285a8a78e60a626f51be08.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](images/79/79c39d7b4ce2da3caf61548d55f4f12cc1e6c64b166c7c808d2d9694aa5ea7a9.png)" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425481 1068 #edb/ref 17592186425477 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425481 1069 "q-150314" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425481 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425481 1071 "![](images/d2/d21ab50b6b1958d0871d1bc979cbcbcb074c5b150dd46e5d15f15e935c7adbd5.png)\n\nWhat picture is missing from the multiplication model above?" 13194139534554 17592186045417 true] [17592186425481 1072 #uuid "2d628c4f-e215-5e07-bc45-85d94b6b9aa4" 1